      "content": "hey, i'm stuck on this monthly reconciliation macro and it's driving me crazy. i keep getting run-time error '1004': application-defined or object-defined error right here:\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Monthly_Report\")\n    ws.Range(\"A1:Z100\").Value = DataArray\n    ws.Columns(\"A:Z\").AutoFit\nEnd Sub\n\nthe DataArray is definitely populated, i checked it in the locals window. looks like there's some kind of bug in how the range is interacting with the array. can you help me fix this?",
